!Castle Oztroja S-img.jpg||
=4 Walkthrough
>**__Note: This special campaign ops is only available when Castle Oztroja (S) is under the control of Windurst.**__
* Head to {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} after selecting the mission.
* Obtain a {k:Xicu's Rosary|Xicu's rosary} ({p:Key Item}).
** The key item drops off any of the Yagudo's in {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} (excluding NM's).
** It can be obtained when the campaign op isn't flagged, so check that you don't have it before you begin farming it.
** Every member of the party currently in the zone will receive a stone when it drops.
* Make your way to the top floor and examine the **Collapsing Floor** (H-7) to enter the battlefield.

=5 Plucking Wings
* Trusts can be summoned and there is no level cap for this battlefield.
* Inside the battlefield, you will face four Yagudo NMs.
** {m:Soo Luma the Ascended} ({p:SCH})
** {m:Jii Xai the Rimebladed} ({p:SAM})
** {m:Roo Beju the Eulogizer} ({p:BRD})
** {m:Zjaa Bao the Wrathherald} ({p:NIN})
* Only {m:Soo Luma the Ascended} has to be defeated to win the fight.
** {m:Soo Luma the Ascended} will use {p:Tabula Rasa} and has access to all tier IV Black Magic as well as White Magic spells.
** He has an apparently permanent {p:Accession} and {p:Manifestation} status, which causes all of the appropriate spells to be AoE, centered on the target.
** {m:Soo Luma the Ascended} is immune to {s:Sleep}, but nothing else.
* His helpers are much weaker, with no known immunities. They will respawn shortly after they are defeated. The helpers share hate with {m:Soo Luma the Ascended}.
* Once {m:Soo Luma the Ascended} is defeated, an {p:Armoury Crate} will spawn.
* Return to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

